Package: dgraphs
Title: Data-Derived Graph Construction Utilities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Peter", "Gajer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pgajer@example.com")
    )
Description: Data-derived graph construction utilities split out from gflow.
    The package provides local ANN-backed kNN, intersection-kNN, geodesic-kNN,
    radius, adaptive-radius, SkNN, and MST-completion graph constructors.
